{"id":4980,"date":"2025-08-05T11:52:18","date_gmt":"2025-08-05T11:52:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4980"},"modified":"2025-08-11T07:23:59","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T07:23:59","slug":"cach-luu-anh-tren-tiktok","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/cach-luu-anh-tren-tiktok\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch l\u01b0u \u1ea3nh tr\u00ean TikTok m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 n\u00fat l\u01b0u"},"content":{"rendered":"<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"A4pPdIwVxoGd5gxLRUmlI4ivg7d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCrDduXAIo68Loxf4aDlz6yjgzf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong th\u1eddi \u0111\u1ea1i c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 s\u1ed1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n nh\u01b0 v\u0169 b\u00e3o, khi m\u00e0 c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i nh\u01b0 TikTok \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, vi\u1ec7c l\u01b0u gi\u1eef nh\u1eefng kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1eaft hay nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o t\u1eeb c\u00e1c video ng\u1eafn \u0111ang ng\u00e0y c\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi quan t\u00e2m. Kh\u00f4ng \u00edt ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng th\u1eafc m\u1eafc li\u1ec7u c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1 v\u00e0 l\u01b0u tr\u1eef nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u1eeb TikTok m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng hay kh\u00f4ng, nh\u1ea5t l\u00e0 khi m\u1ed7i b\u00e0i \u0111\u0103ng \u0111\u1ec1u mang m\u1ed9t d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang, t\u1eeb hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng b\u1eaft m\u1eaft \u0111\u1ebfn n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o. V\u1eady, l\u00e0m th\u1ebf n\u00e0o \u0111\u1ec3 l\u01b0u \u1ea3nh t\u1eeb TikTok v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3? H\u00e3y c\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>Lemon Digita<\/strong><\/span><\/a><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">l<\/span> \u0111i t\u00ecm l\u1eddi gi\u1ea3i cho v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 n\u00e0y nh\u00e9!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RaJcdLGUqo5vSjxrA27lVO43gem\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-LTxfdhg9Ho41CJx3j3BljO4RgHh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. C\u00f3 l\u01b0u \u1ea3nh tr\u00ean TikTok \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5011\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5011\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5011\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/topic.png\" alt=\"Hashtag TikTok l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng t\u1eeb ho\u1eb7c c\u1ee5m t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vi\u1ebft li\u1ec1n nhau v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7t sau d\u1ea5u \u201c#\u201d\" width=\"1200\" height=\"682\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/topic.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/topic-300x171.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/topic-1024x582.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/topic-768x436.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/topic-600x341.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5011\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Hashtag TikTok l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng t\u1eeb ho\u1eb7c c\u1ee5m t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vi\u1ebft li\u1ec1n nhau v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7t sau d\u1ea5u \u201c#\u201d<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FbLgdR4Xgo7AIixVEl4l53ytgt3\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u1edbi c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi n\u00e0y, c\u00e2u tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi l\u00e0 b\u1ea1n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u01b0u \u1ea3nh tr\u00ean TikTok v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng. Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n m\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, t\u00ecm video ho\u1eb7c b\u00e0i \u0111\u0103ng ch\u1ee9a \u1ea3nh, nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng &#8220;Chia s\u1ebb&#8221; v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn &#8220;L\u01b0u \u1ea3nh&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea3i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u00e0o th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n. N\u1ebfu t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn n\u00e0y b\u1ecb t\u1eaft, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ee5p m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 SnapTik b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u00e0 t\u1ea3i \u1ea3nh kh\u00f4ng d\u00ednh logo qua website ho\u1eb7c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng SnapTik. Ngo\u00e0i ra, TikTok h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp trong ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 camera, cho ph\u00e9p l\u01b0u \u1ea3nh m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n th\u00eam b\u01b0\u1edbc ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda. L\u01b0u \u00fd ch\u1ec9 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u1ea3nh cho m\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh vi ph\u1ea1m b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FPxTd3dOZorHlxxxuBclwKjsgnb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-JMvidT0Uyo8PO1xnlCrlQTG0gtb\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. C\u00e1ch l\u01b0u \u1ea3nh TikTok m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 n\u00fat l\u01b0u<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P1wIdnVxWos8H5xJdPKldpYlgVc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi b\u00e0i \u0111\u0103ng TikTok kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 n\u00fat \u201cL\u01b0u \u1ea3nh\u201d, ngh\u0129a l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eaft quy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i xu\u1ed1ng. Tuy v\u1eady, b\u1ea1n v\u1eabn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u01b0u \u1ea3nh theo m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e1ch kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n n\u00fat l\u01b0u, t\u00f9y thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o d\u1ea1ng n\u1ed9i dung l\u00e0 \u1ea3nh \u0111\u01a1n hay slideshow.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Bcm7doAu0oa1vuxqoiul6xdKgJe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p 1: L\u01b0u \u1ea3nh t\u1eeb video TikTok kh\u00f4ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ec9 Live Photo<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YXatdmzocowqBCxjTBvlZl0tgRe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1:<\/strong> T\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn video c\u00f3 c\u1ea3nh b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i th\u00e0nh \u1ea3nh, m\u1edf \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 to\u00e0n m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CFh7dcHYuoOPHExC7bElvAFUged\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2:<\/strong> T\u1ea1m d\u1eebng \u1edf khung h\u00ecnh b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n. C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 k\u00e9o nh\u1eb9 thanh th\u1eddi gian \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D1uyd3UCOoz0mLx8PWKlMLnqgWd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3:<\/strong> Ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh<\/div>\n<blockquote class=\" old-record-id-CJPbdoa0ToL6LAxoeEklHupwgPe\" data-type=\"quote_container\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EIc5dI77joD4AQx9ZvglG4cNgkg\"><strong>iPhone:<\/strong> Nh\u1ea5n <strong>Ngu\u1ed3n + T\u0103ng \u00e2m l\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5014\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5014\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5014\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/28.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1ch ch\u1ee5p m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh iPhone\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/28.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/28-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/28-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/28-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/28-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5014\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1ch ch\u1ee5p m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh iPhone<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<blockquote class=\" old-record-id-CJPbdoa0ToL6LAxoeEklHupwgPe\" data-type=\"quote_container\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TWivdeovQoMOOzxkqVDldjQRgZf\"><strong>Android:<\/strong> Nh\u1ea5n <strong>Ngu\u1ed3n + Gi\u1ea3m \u00e2m l\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/strong> (ho\u1eb7c d\u00f9ng thao t\u00e1c 3 ng\u00f3n tay vu\u1ed1t xu\u1ed1ng).<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5013\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5013\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5013\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/27.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1ch ch\u1ee5p m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh android\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/27.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/27-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/27-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/27-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/27-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5013\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1ch ch\u1ee5p m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh android<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<blockquote class=\" old-record-id-CJPbdoa0ToL6LAxoeEklHupwgPe\" data-type=\"quote_container\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O1mcdscK8oPPfWxZCICllkyDgUg\"><strong>M\u00e1y t\u00ednh:<\/strong> D\u00f9ng ph\u00edm <strong>Print Screen<\/strong> ho\u1eb7c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 <strong>Snipping Tool<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PxoRdCM9ZozeGZxMFzLldA4fgqf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4:<\/strong> M\u1edf \u1ea3nh trong th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 c\u1eaft \u0111\u1ec3 lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf ph\u1ea7n logo TikTok (th\u01b0\u1eddng \u1edf g\u00f3c d\u01b0\u1edbi b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i) ho\u1eb7c t\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng v\u00e0 n\u00fat like\/comment (\u1edf b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Ll5Fdlj76oEn2rxrTUslYA3Zgkb\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p 2: C\u00e1ch l\u01b0u \u1ea3nh TikTok b\u1eb1ng Live Photo <\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EY7adGZMioFQVPxLkZZlXcVpgah\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Live Photo gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n l\u01b0u m\u1ed9t \u0111o\u1ea1n ng\u1eafn video t\u1eeb TikTok nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ed9ng, sau \u0111\u00f3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn khung \u1ea3nh mong mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LzXBdX6auogPpkxKsCGlzu0fgke\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: M\u1edf video TikTok &gt; <\/strong>Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o <strong>bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng chia s\u1ebb<\/strong> (h\u00ecnh m\u0169i t\u00ean cong) \u1edf g\u00f3c d\u01b0\u1edbi b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TKSAdMDvSo4lMAxWwTVlKqubgwf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q7XjdmqTAouLEmxAPBAlkWPMgjb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: <\/strong>T\u1ea1i b\u1ea3ng tu\u1ef3 ch\u1ecdn chia s\u1ebb hi\u1ec7n ra &gt; ch\u1ecdn <strong>\u201cLive Photo\u201d<\/strong> (bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng h\u00ecnh tr\u00f2n \u0111en tr\u1eafng c\u00f3 d\u00f2ng ch\u1eef &#8220;Live Photo&#8221;).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVXbdR3euo7veWxFEdDlQAYhgIf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZeBtdy7vPoERjex5aWrlOEojgtb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: <\/strong>Sau khi ch\u1ecdn Live Photo &gt; M\u00e0n h\u00ecnh s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb ti\u1ebfn tr\u00ecnh \u0111ang t\u1ea3i (B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n ch\u1edd trong v\u00e0i gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t.)<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HJZodsC2boOGdgxF8F8l9pingRK\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BFbHdnu0koTCc2xct8Yll1WEgHb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: <\/strong>Khi qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh t\u1ea3i Live Photo ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t. M\u00e0n h\u00ecnh s\u1ebd xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o: <strong>\u201cLive Photo \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng\u2026\u201d<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZX4odfpwaoSFMRxqhYVl2vNYg70\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u1ea2nh s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u trong th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n \u1ea2nh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n (Album \u201cLive Photos\u201d).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5012\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5012\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5012\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/LIVE.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1ch l\u01b0u \u1ea3nh TikTok b\u1eb1ng Live Photo\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/LIVE.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/LIVE-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/LIVE-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/LIVE-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/LIVE-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5012\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1ch l\u01b0u \u1ea3nh TikTok b\u1eb1ng Live Photo<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BooSdrPyhoriCnxRnYIlRgGXgLe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-XDtCdtMDsoRER8x4ed9lxAQRgad\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>4. L\u01b0u \u00fd khi l\u01b0u \u1ea3nh TikTok kh\u00f4ng logo<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OPIEdgeH4ohW4NxHwuFlVLNRg0g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok, nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1 \u1ea3nh ho\u1eb7c video t\u1eeb n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 l\u01b0u tr\u1eef ho\u1eb7c chia s\u1ebb l\u1ea1i. Tuy nhi\u00ean, khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea3i \u1ea3nh kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 logo TikTok, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\u1ea9n tr\u1ecdng v\u00ec \u0111i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n, quy\u1ec1n ri\u00eang t\u01b0 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt d\u1eef li\u1ec7u. Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u01b0\u1edfng nh\u01b0 \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n n\u00e0y, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean n\u1eafm r\u00f5 nh\u1eefng l\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh r\u1ee7i ro ph\u00e1p l\u00fd c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o an to\u00e0n cho thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb v\u00e0 th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FQUKd37MBoy4YrxoAHlliifgg7c\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>4.1. B\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1ee3p ph\u00e1p<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FxGHdvuAwoKZcBx6zprl4rOxgOe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c t\u1ea3i \u1ea3nh TikTok kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 logo ti\u1ec1m \u1ea9n r\u1ee7i ro vi ph\u1ea1m b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n, v\u00ec m\u1ecdi \u1ea3nh\/video \u0111\u1ec1u thu\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n s\u1edf h\u1eefu c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng, k\u1ec3 c\u1ea3 khi c\u00f4ng khai. X\u00f3a watermark ho\u1eb7c d\u00f9ng \u1ea3nh kh\u00f4ng logo m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok v\u00e0 lu\u1eadt s\u1edf h\u1eefu tr\u00ed tu\u1ec7. Do \u0111\u00f3, ch\u1ec9 n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u1ea3nh kh\u00f4ng logo cho m\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n nh\u01b0 s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi, v\u00e0 tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i tr\u00e1nh d\u00f9ng cho qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung gi\u1ea3 m\u1ea1o hay reup n\u1ebfu ch\u01b0a c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 cho ph\u00e9p c\u1ee7a t\u00e1c gi\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5008\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5008\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5008\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ban-quyen.png\" alt=\"kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok v\u00e0 lu\u1eadt s\u1edf h\u1eefu tr\u00ed tu\u1ec7\" width=\"1200\" height=\"682\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ban-quyen.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ban-quyen-300x171.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ban-quyen-1024x582.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ban-quyen-768x436.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ban-quyen-600x341.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5008\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok v\u00e0 lu\u1eadt s\u1edf h\u1eefu tr\u00ed tu\u1ec7<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-OehodQl6Yo3D1SxA1Avlm5XFg5g\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>4.2. An to\u00e0n b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt khi d\u00f9ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 b\u00ean th\u1ee9 3<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MJYFdouvHoboVhxVcCvlqgXWgbg\">Khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 t\u1ea3i \u1ea3nh\/video t\u1eeb TikTok nh\u01b0 SnapTik hay TikGo, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n ch\u1ecdn trang uy t\u00edn, kh\u00f4ng y\u00eau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp hay th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n. H\u00e3y \u01b0u ti\u00ean c\u00e1c trang c\u00f3 b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt (https:\/\/), tr\u00e1nh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ed9c h\u1ea1i v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng n\u00ean c\u00e0i \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng t\u1eeb ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ea1. Ngo\u00e0i ra, \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u, h\u00e3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t \u1ea9n danh v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean x\u00f3a cache, cookies khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 b\u00ean th\u1ee9 ba.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5007\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5007\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5007\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/An-toan-bao-mat-khi-dung-cong-cu-ben-thu-3.png\" alt=\"h\u00e3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t \u1ea9n danh v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean x\u00f3a cache, cookies\" width=\"1200\" height=\"682\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/An-toan-bao-mat-khi-dung-cong-cu-ben-thu-3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/An-toan-bao-mat-khi-dung-cong-cu-ben-thu-3-300x171.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/An-toan-bao-mat-khi-dung-cong-cu-ben-thu-3-1024x582.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/An-toan-bao-mat-khi-dung-cong-cu-ben-thu-3-768x436.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/An-toan-bao-mat-khi-dung-cong-cu-ben-thu-3-600x341.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5007\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">H\u00e3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t \u1ea9n danh v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean x\u00f3a cache, cookies<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hs4ld1bTno09E0xayiZlQPcNgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXjcdxwmZoWKXWx2UonlRnRagXf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DbKTdkhWYoO6U4xrDw5lJAneg7d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1uLdZxz9o0PTAxKBZRllhjTgUd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O9KWdu2pTo6MwFxvXFgltbDcgse\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B0WcdXMVaocQq6xInUDlXkDrgNc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Trong th\u1eddi \u0111\u1ea1i c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 s\u1ed1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n nh\u01b0 v\u0169 b\u00e3o, khi m\u00e0 c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i nh\u01b0 TikTok \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, vi\u1ec7c l\u01b0u gi\u1eef nh\u1eefng kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1eaft hay nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o t\u1eeb c\u00e1c video ng\u1eafn \u0111ang ng\u00e0y c\u00e0ng [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5045,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4980","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-tiktok","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4980","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4980"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4980\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5215,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4980\/revisions\/5215"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5045"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4980"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4980"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4980"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}